<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Daimler-Benz.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Daimler-Benz.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerische Bankverein (Deutschland) AG has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Daimler-Benz ordinary shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>ONE WARRANT CONTROLS ONE SHARE.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 04.JUL.97-25.JUN.99   PAYDATE	03.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  141 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p>		 STRIKE     ISSUE     PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	  160 DEM    18.50 DEM 26.6 PCT   7.62 X</p>
<p> CALL	  180 DEM    13.O DEM  36.88 PCT  10.85 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
